# ─── doctor-tracker-web ───────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Copy to .env.local. Nothing here is a secret: no keys reach the browser,
# because the client only ever talks to its own origin.

# Where the Express API lives. Next rewrites /api/v1/* to this host
# (see next.config.ts), so the browser never sees it and the auth cookies stay
# first-party. In production this is the Render service URL, e.g.
#   API_INTERNAL_URL=https://doctor-tracker-api.onrender.com
API_INTERNAL_URL=http://127.0.0.1:5000
